<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<app version="1">
	<name>miniCDi</name>
	<coder>Mr. Lechkar</coder>
	<version>@PROJECT_VERSION@</version>
	<release_date>@PROJECT_BUILDDATE@</release_date>
	<short_description>Philips CD-i emulator</short_description>
	<long_description>An experimental Philips CD-i emulator. Currently does not support sound or MPEG, and some games may not be compatible.

In order for it to run you must provide a copy of the system ROM (either CD-i 220/20 or CD-i 490) in apps/miniCDi/rom/*.rom.

Special credits to Stovent, CD-i Fan and Slamy for their assistance and for documentation of the CD-i hardware. The source code was partially based off of Stovent's implementations of the relevant components in CeDImu, as well as CD-i Fan's cdichips documentation of several components including the MCD212, SCC68070 (UART), IKAT and SLAVE. The emulator uses Musashi version 4.10 as a core for the 68070 processor.
</long_description>
</app>